      {
        "script_id": "nephrotic-syndrome",
        "how_to_tell_apart": "Nephrotic syndrome has heavy proteinuria above 3.5 g/day, low albumin and a bland urine sediment; nephritic syndrome has red blood cell casts, hypertension and a rising creatinine."
